        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_756_1965.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruntlich</unclear> willig diennst unnd was wir erenn,
<lb n="2"/>liebs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> guots vermoegend zuovor, fromen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fursichtigen</unclear> ersamen
<lb n="3"/>unnd wisen, besonnders guot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frund</unclear> unnd getruwen lieben
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuren</unclear>. Es sind die erbern <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Michel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uoßer</unclear></persName> sampt sin
<lb n="5"/>eliche husfrow unnser lanndtlut vor unns erschinen
<lb n="6"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzoegung</unclear> wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> der ersam <persName resp="#ner">Hanns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Guntzhwoner</unclear></persName> burger
<lb n="7"/>zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanntgallenn</placeName>, sin hab unnd guot willens zuo ver
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">machen</unclear> wie unnd an welliche end unnd ort es nach
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">absterbenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vallenn</unclear> soelle, unnd aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">si</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelts</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Michels</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eeliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">husfrowenn</unclear>, deren er alß wol ain vetter.
<lb n="11"/>alß andrenn so er das guot willens <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuomachen</unclear>, darvon
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thrennngenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welle</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursach</unclear>, wie ervermaint. Das er
<lb n="13"/>gemelts <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Michels</unclear></persName> frowen vatter und ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vil</unclear> guots bewisen
<lb n="14"/>hab. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derhalbenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellennd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">si</unclear> bede <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eügath</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Guntzhwoners</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gann</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">globlich</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schin</unclear> bringenn unnd erzogen, weß si gsines sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">har</unclear> inn
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zehalte</unclear>, mit gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trunngenlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pit</unclear> uns an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelangt</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derhalb</unclear> ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mainung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">globlich</unclear> schin
<lb n="19"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuthailenn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dasi</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwillgen</unclear> wellend
<lb n="20"/>den gemaches Guntzhwoner, dz guot in ander weg
<lb n="21"/>zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermachenn</unclear> sonnder wie es gott fuog unnd lend
<lb n="22"/>was dz recht gibt zuo erwarten, unnd ver mainend hie
<lb n="23"/>mit, mit den andrenn siner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eerennd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">basinen</unclear> gesundert
<lb n="24"/>zesin, wie wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">si</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sines</unclear> guots wenig thailhaftig
<lb n="25"/>gewordenn, unnd so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear> inen (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">si</unclear> aber ver
<lb n="26"/>mainend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> sin werd) ut bezalt ustunnd. Sinnd si
<lb n="27"/>nit gsinet, im das vor zuo habenn, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoechster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pit</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> arger mainung zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermerken</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_756_1966.JPG" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonnder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> in ander weg, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dom</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelt</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andrenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frömdenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nütt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gpfendett</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geachtett</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>welle sin. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hie</unclear> mit gott <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thrüwlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befoln</unclear>. Datto <origDate resp="#ner">den
<lb n="32"/>2 tag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herpstmonat</unclear> anno etc. im 556 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jr</unclear>.</origDate>
<lb n="33"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-506" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lanndtamman</unclear> und
<lb n="34"/>Ratt zuo Appenzell</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_756_1967.JPG" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_756_1968.JPG" n="4"/>
<lb n="35"/>Den fromen fürsichtigenn ersamen
<lb n="36"/>unnd wysenn <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burgermaister und
<lb n="37"/>ratt der statt Sannt Gallen</orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> fründen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwenn</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>lieben nachpuren.
</p>
